{"text": "8 × (7 - 4) / (8 / 7) = 8 × 3 / (8 / 7) = 24 / (8 / 7) = 24 × 7 / 8 = 21", "start": 845, "end": 917, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "8 × (7 - 4 + (7 - 4/4)) = 8 × (3 + 1) = 8 × 4 = 32", "start": 946, "end": 996, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "8 × (7 - 4) / (7 / 4) = 8 × 3 × (4 / 7) = 24 × (4 / 7) = 13.71", "start": 1023, "end": 1085, "label": "inform"}
